00:58:43.010 --> 00:58:47.160
<v Alec Wilkinson>Mean-looking types with wiry bodies and spiteful, ratty faces.
<v Alec Wilkinson>有着精瘦身体和恶毒、像老鼠一样脸的类型。

00:58:47.160 --> 00:58:56.420
